description	"Praetorian Guard

Elite, highly trained personal bodyguards to Supreme Leader Snoke, equipped with advanced modular melee weaponry and unmatched agility.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Cripples On Hit
-- Fast Movement
-- 10% Faster Attack Rate
- Praetorian Melee Weapon (Various Style Saber)
-- Bisento (Yellow/Purple)
-- Chain Whip (Red/Blue)
-- Voulge (Red/Purple)
-- Dual Blades (Duals/Purple)
-- Staff (Staff/Purple)
-- No Blaster Block/Deflect
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Cripples/Staggers On Hit
-- BP Free Jumps
-- Fast Styles Do Less Damage and Vice Versa

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Dexterity (3)
- Stamina (1)
- Assemble (3)
- Knockdown Roll
- Dash Hop
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- Strength (1)
- Personal Shield
- Blast Armor
- Cortosis (1)
- Beskar (2)
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Grapple Hop 

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS1]
- Flipkick (2) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dash ^3[CS3]
- Electro Whip ^3[CS4]
-- Ignites/Staggers/Cripples/Pulses/Pulls On Hit"